      "cooked": "<p>Well, this is my first attempt at Sentinels of the Multiverse fan fiction, and it's holiday-related -- a Sentinels of the Multiverse/Freedom Five take on \"It's a Wonderful Life.\" I love Sentinels of the Multiverse, but I'm no expert on canon or timeline, so it's a bit off canon, I'm sure, but it's all in good fun to have a nice Christmas-themed Sentinels story.</p>\n<p>Enjoy and happy holidays!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://archiveofourown.org/works/28287687\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\"It's a Wonderful Legacy\"</a></p>\n<p>(I tried to post it to these forums directly, but it kept pasting it all in bold with no way for me to unbold it, so a link to its place on AO3 will have to suffice, at least for now).</p>",
